## Unresponsive script dialog

# The & character marks the access key of the checkbox label.
dom-slow-script-dialog-dont-ask-again = Ani eporandujey chéve
dom-slow-script-dialog-stop-button = Script mombyta
dom-slow-script-dialog-continue-button = Jeku’ejey
# Variables:
#   $extensionName (String) - Name of the extension running the script.
dom-slow-addon-script-dialog-message =
    Peteĩ script “{ $extensionName }” jepysokue ombohapéma ko kuatiaroguépe ha péva rupi { -brand-short-name } ndoikói hína.
    
    Ikatu ojeporu térã ikatu avei ndoikovéima. Ikatu hína ejoko script ko’ág̃a térã ikatu avei eku’e henyhẽ peve.
dom-slow-addon-script-dialog-checkbox = Emombia script jepysokue ombohape ko kuatiaroguépe oñemoñepyrũjey peve
